<h1>Account deactivated</h1>
<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name %>, an administrator of <%= Rails.configuration.x.app.name %> deactivated your account and signed it out of every device.</p>
<p>Your data was kept. You will not be able to log in until the account is reactivated.</p>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px">If you think this is a mistake, contact the administrators of <%= Rails.configuration.x.app.name %>.</p>
